//! Port of `lib/Platinenmacher/error.h` (`error_code_t`).
//!
//! **Temporary home.** `rust/PORTING.md` puts this enum in `pm-core` as
//! `pm_core::Error`, and every public API returns `Result<T, Error>`. At the
